<title>MOROCCO: Casablanca port traffic rises 12 pct in February.</title>
<headline>Casablanca port traffic rises 12 pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's main Casablanca port handled 12 percent more traffic in February 1997 compared with the same period last year, due mainly to soaring exports, the official Moroccan news agency MAP said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The port handled 2.8 million tonnes, compared with 2.5 million tonnes in February 1996, said MAP.</p>
<p>Exports rose to 1.67 million tonnes from 1.2 million.</p>
<p>But imports fell to 1.13 million tonnes from 1.29 million.</p>
</text>
